    {
      "text": "在数字世界中，密码就像您个人宝箱的钥匙，但让我们面对现实，它们更像是一堆您需要时找不到但其他人不知何故可以找到的便利贴。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们能在某种程度上消除密码吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "是的，使用 Passkeys。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Passkey 是一种用于保护对各种在线服务和账户的访问的验证方法。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它是一个唯一的密钥对，由为个别用户专门生成的公钥和私钥组成",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
