        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "记得阅读 https://www.passkeys.io/#How-to-use-a-passkey 的说明。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以为同一账户在多个设备上创建 passkey。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往无缝安全的门户",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
